<title>USA: IPO FILING - Vistana Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Vistana Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			Vistana Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			 VSTN.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    5.55 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 4.625 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  925,000 Shrs outstanding after ipo    18.8 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		  Montgomery Securities</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment   832,500 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Developer and operator of timeshare resorts in the U.S. Use of Proceeds: To repay a portion of the company's outstanding debt, to fund the cost of an acqusition, for development and expansion of existing and future vacation ownership resorts and for working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
